  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\n### Summary\n\nIn update document for history step application, NavigationActivation is updated before the Navigation API entry list is refreshed during BFCache reactivation.\n\nWhen navigating from same-origin page A to page B and back to A, this can cause previousEntryIndex to be -1 and navigation.activation.from to become null, even though Chromium exposes page B's entry.\n\n### Question\n\nShould the entry list be updated before calculating previousEntryIndex? If so, how should this ordering interact with BFCache reactivation and WebDriver BiDi navigation steps?\n\nThis issue is separate from whatwg/html#13315 to keep that PR focused.\n\nRelated: whatwg/html#13315, web-platform-tests/wpt#65675.",
